# B-337: Exact-value match on named-field constructor.
# 2-arg [case ...] form now requires 3 args (T-1151).
# The new form is [case [let bindings] pattern body].
[Result: [type [let a] [Ok value: a] [Error msg: Str]]]
[result: [match [Ok value: 1]
  [case [Ok value: 1] "hit"]
  _: "miss"]]
=== out
Dict({"result": String("miss")})
